source: crates/ostro-cli/tests/p14_cli.rs
expression: t
---
$ ostro auth token create --scope read
usage: error: the following required arguments were not provided:
[exit 2]
$ ostro auth token create --name x
usage: error: the following required arguments were not provided:
[exit 2]
$ ostro auth token create --name x --scope root
usage: error: invalid value 'root' for '--scope <SCOPES>': unknown scope "root" (expected admin, deploy, operate, trigger or read)
[exit 2]
$ ostro auth token create --name x --scope read --tenant acme --system
usage: error: the argument '--tenant <TENANT>' cannot be used with '--system'
[exit 2]
$ ostro auth token create --name x --scope read --ttl 1h --no-expiry
usage: error: the argument '--ttl <TTL>' cannot be used with '--no-expiry'
[exit 2]
$ ostro auth token create --name x --scope read --ttl 7d
usage: error: invalid value '7d' for '--ttl <TTL>': invalid duration "7d": days and weeks are not accepted, write it as 168h
[exit 2]
$ ostro auth token revoke
usage: error: the following required arguments were not provided:
[exit 2]
